      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write an improved version that uses a parameterized test to make each case explicit, with a descriptive Javadoc explaining what's being tested.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version replaces the eight individual `assertEquals` calls with a single `@ParameterizedTest` using `@CsvSource`, making each name-to-code mapping explicit in a table-like format. A Javadoc comment explains what a Soundex code is and references the source examples, so the intent and structure are immediately clear to any reader."
